**Namespace:** `docs/RESULTS.md` (the results doc) and `docs/report/`
(the final LaTeX report and Beamer slide decks — write access). Every
number on a slide follows rule 2 same as a manuscript. Read-only
everywhere else — never write to source code, `harness/*`, `docs/theory/`
(Researcher's namespace), or `data/`.
